    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for the SF Compute (San Francisco Compute Company) GPU compute marketplace. Place buy/sell market orders for blocks of H100 GPU-hours, list and retrieve tradable cluster contracts, request live market quotes, read account balance, and provision managed-Kubernetes clusters, nodes, and VM instances. All endpoints require a Bearer API token generated with `sf tokens create`.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: SF Compute Support\n Email: hello@sfcompute.com",
